%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_51D8
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_51D9
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_51E8
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_51E9
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_51EA
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_51EB
