%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_54EB
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_7E50
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_7E51
%IntelLPSSI2C.DeviceDesc% = IntelLPSSI2C_Install, PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_7E78
